abstract: >-
  A beginner module that prepares learners for the rest of the curriculum:
  running Jupyter notebooks in Google Colab, Python basics (variables,
  strings, lists, dictionaries, loops and functions), tables with pandas and
  charts with matplotlib, geospatial Python with GeoPandas (vector data,
  coordinate reference systems, attribute and spatial joins), and a first map
  in QGIS. It also holds the central setup guide for the curriculum.
keywords:
  - GIS
  - Python
  - Google Colab
  - pandas
  - matplotlib
  - GeoPandas
  - coordinate reference systems
  - QGIS
  - beginners
  - social science
